# What gcloud builds submit leaves out of the parser's source upload: what
# git ignores, git's own files, and the credentials file the deploy job's
# auth step writes into the checkout (gha-creds-*.json), which holds a
# GitHub OIDC token and must never reach the source bucket or the image.
.git
.gitignore
gha-creds-*.json
#!include:.gitignore
